WEBVTT

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:32.195
while studying the links
between women and climate

00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:33.780
over the last years.

00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:37.408
Our research has shown
that climate action,

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.368
as it is unfolding,

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:43.247
could set gender equality
back by 15 years.

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:46.000
I'm going to say that again.

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:49.295
So climate action, not climate change,

00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:50.755
climate action,

00:00:50.755 --> 00:00:53.132
meaning all the efforts
that are being made

00:00:53.174 --> 00:00:54.634
to reduce our emissions,

00:00:54.675 --> 00:00:57.637
to adapt our lives to a warmer planet,

00:00:57.678 --> 00:01:01.307
could actually set gender equality
back by 15 years.